      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为了求出方程（1）所有的解，只要在长度为 $\\pi$ 的任一闭区",
        "间上（因为余切的周期是 $\\pi$）求",
        "出这个方程所有的解就行了。由",
        "图41可以看出，取区间 $]0,\\pi[$ 比",
        "较方便。根据反余切的定义，在",
        "区间 $]0,\\pi[$ 上，方程（1）的解是",
        "$\\operatorname{arcctg}a$。现在，为了写出方程",
        "（1）所有的解，必须利用余切函",
        "数的周期性，就是把 $\\operatorname{arcctg}a$ 加",
        "上 $\\pi n(n\\in Z)$ 这种形式的数，得到解："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 41",
      "box": [
        945,
        397,
        465,
        550
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-41"
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图 41",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": true,
      "lines": [
        "图 41"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$x=\\operatorname{arcctg}a+\\pi n(n\\in Z)$。 （2）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例2 解方程",
        "$\\operatorname{ctg}x=1$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "根据（2）式得到：",
        "$x=\\operatorname{arcctg}1+\\pi k$，$x=\\frac{\\pi}{4}+\\pi k$，$k\\in Z$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例3 解方程",
        "$\\operatorname{ctg}x=\\sqrt{3}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "根据（2）式得到：",
        "$x=\\operatorname{arcctg}\\sqrt{3}+\\pi k$，$x=\\frac{\\pi}{6}+\\pi k$，$k\\in Z$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "现在列出余切的基本性质。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1. 函数的定义域是去掉 $\\pi n$（其中 $n\\in Z$）这种形式的数以",
        "外所有实数集合。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "2. 余切函数值的集合是整个数轴：$E(\\operatorname{ctg})=R$。因此，",
        "余切是无界函数。"
      ]
    },
